WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:07.840
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Comedy short film called “Alternative&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:19.200
Math.” Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
The premise of the movie is set in a “post-fact”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.640
American society where everything you say&nbsp;
has to align with everyone else’s opinion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:31.280
In an elementary school, math teacher Mrs. Wells&nbsp;
invites a student, Danny, to her class. Danny has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:37.280
failed his recent math test terribly and is very&nbsp;
mad about it. However, he isn’t mad that he didn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:42.800
do well on the test, instead, he is bothered by&nbsp;
the teacher who gave him bad grades and said all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:48.720
of his answers were wrong. Danny shows Mrs. Wells&nbsp;
his answer sheet full of red markings and a big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.480
F on the top. The teacher calmly takes a look at&nbsp;
his paper and explains that his answers are wrong.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.840
Seeing that the kid has written two plus two&nbsp;
is equal to twenty-two, it is clear that he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:07.520
having some trouble with addition. Being the&nbsp;
good teacher that she is, Mrs. Wells asks the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:13.520
boy to not be upset because it is normal for&nbsp;
kids his age to be confused by numbers. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:18.320
explains that he is here to learn and that making&nbsp;
mistakes is a part of the learning experience.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:24.080
But by the look on Danny’s face, her kind words&nbsp;
went over his head. He expresses his confusion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:30.800
with a sassy “nuh-uh” to his teacher’s face. 
Mrs. Wells remains composed and asks him to look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:36.400
at the questions again. She points out his obvious&nbsp;
mistake but Danny seems to be uninterested. Mrs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:41.200
Wells further explains that two plus two doesn’t&nbsp;
equal twenty-two because addition doesn’t mean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.560
you can just put the numbers next to each other,&nbsp;
you have to add them. As she explains how he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:51.920
add the numbers, the kid scoffs and says that her&nbsp;
method is stupid. The woman manages to suppress&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:57.440
her frustration and tries giving him a practical&nbsp;
example. She brings out two markers in each of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:02.720
her hands and puts them together asking the kid&nbsp;
how many markers she has in total. With all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:08.640
sass he can gather, Danny replies that the answer&nbsp;
is twenty-two. Finally starting to get irritated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:14.480
Mrs. Wells tells him he is wrong and the obvious&nbsp;
answer is four. The spoiled kid pushes the box&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:20.160
of markers off the desk and storms out of the&nbsp;
classroom in anger. Mrs. Wells is left speechless&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:25.280
by the kid’s behavior but she doesn’t think much&nbsp;
of it. Until the very next day when his parents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:30.080
come to her classroom with a complaint. 
At first, they introduce themselves politely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.800
and take a seat at Mrs. Wells’s request.&nbsp;
Before the parents can voice their concerns,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:39.040
the teacher assures them that there is nothing&nbsp;
to worry about. She further adds that it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:43.040
completely normal for kids like Danny to get&nbsp;
frustrated when they are struggling with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:48.480
subject, especially a subject like math where they&nbsp;
can hardly use their creativity. Danny’s mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:57.520
doesn’t seem to be grateful for Mrs. Wells’s kind&nbsp;
words. She ignores everything the teacher says and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:03.600
asks why Danny is getting some answers wrong in&nbsp;
her “so-called” test. Mrs. Wells is taken aback by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:09.200
the rudeness but doesn’t show it in her face. She&nbsp;
composes herself and starts explaining what kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:14.080
of questions were on the test. After she states&nbsp;
that Danny’s answer to the question; what is two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:20.080
plus two was twenty-two, the room goes silent.&nbsp;
One might think the parents realized that it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:25.840
their son’s mistake but to Mrs. Wells’s surprise,&nbsp;
they ask her to go on, waiting for her to prove&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:32.000
her point. It is clear that the couple doesn’t&nbsp;
understand that the kid’s answer is wrong. 
&nbsp;

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.440
The teacher bluntly says that twenty-two is not&nbsp;
the right answer. The mother, in utter disbelief,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:43.280
asks Mrs. Wells who says that the answer is wrong.&nbsp;
Mrs. Wells replies that is how math works. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:48.640
couple misses the whole point and accuses Mrs.&nbsp;
Wells of calling their son stupid. The teacher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:53.120
explains that it was not her intention and that&nbsp;
she is simply trying to correct his mistake.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:58.880
Things get heated when the dad starts to yell. He&nbsp;
asks Mrs. Wells who she is to declare his son’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:05.360
answer is wrong and hers is right. Mrs. Wells is&nbsp;
in complete shock at the stupidity of the couple.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:10.400
She tries to reason with them stating that the&nbsp;
answers are factual and they would never change.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:15.680
The mother acts like she understands Mrs.&nbsp;
Wells’s words but then accuses her of being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:21.520
a Nazi and forcing absolute answers&nbsp;
on her child. Confused by everything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:26.800
the teacher bluntly asks the two if they know&nbsp;
what two plus two equals to. Instead of an answer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:32.960
Mrs. Wells gets insults thrown at her. The father&nbsp;
calls her a smart ass tramp then mocks her accent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:38.800
Their politeness from a while ago vanishes in&nbsp;
thin air as they get more and more aggressive. 
&nbsp;

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:43.760
Still being respectful, Mrs. Wells tells them&nbsp;
that she can no longer continue the conversation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.240
and shows them the way out. Danny’s mother claims&nbsp;
that they are going to complain to the principal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:52.800
while his father shouts his son is a free&nbsp;
thinker for saying the answer is twenty-two.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:57.200
Before leaving, the mother threatens to get&nbsp;
her kicked out of the job and calls her a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:02.880
bitch. Having had enough of the two, Mrs. Wells&nbsp;
sarcastically shames them for not knowing what two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:09.360
plus two is. The scene abruptly ends as the mother&nbsp;
slaps Mrs. Wells on her face. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:14.000
the principal comes to Mrs. Wells’s class to&nbsp;
discuss the matter. He immediately gets to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:18.960
point and asks her what the issue was with Danny’s&nbsp;
parents. Mrs. Wells announces that it got a little&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:23.760
crazy because the parents weren’t cooperating.&nbsp;
She inquires how the management is handling the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:29.520
situation only to find out that they want her to&nbsp;
apologize to the parents. This makes her even mad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:34.320
because the mother was the one who hit her. The&nbsp;
principal has a problem with Mrs. Wells telling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:39.680
the kids that their answer is wrong. A confused&nbsp;
Mrs. Wells says that it is her job as a teacher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:44.560
to tell them when they make mistakes. However,&nbsp;
the principal doesn’t share the same view. 
&nbsp;

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:49.120
He claims that the teachers should not ram&nbsp;
their biased views down the students’ throats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:54.080
because the students have their own opinions.&nbsp;
In the new and modernized world, everything has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.080 --> 00:06:00.000
to be politically correct. It is wrong to declare&nbsp;
a kid’s answer incorrect because of your opinion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.040
Mrs. Wells is left stunned, she claims that&nbsp;
math cannot be biased because it is factual.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:10.000
The principal starts getting annoyed and says&nbsp;
that Mrs. Wells’s attitude is making the situation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:15.200
worse. He scornfully tells her that she is giving&nbsp;
the children zero respect which is against their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:20.720
school’s policies. That day, a crowd of parents&nbsp;
assembles in front of the school and protests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:26.160
against the teachers’ absolute behavior. Mrs.&nbsp;
Wells is shoved by the crowd who asks her to stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:31.280
undermining their kids’ confidence. Some of them&nbsp;
even demand her to apologize to the parents she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:36.560
offended by claiming that two plus two is four.&nbsp;
Things get worse when they accuse her of hating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:42.000
children in general. Sensing the situation getting&nbsp;
more serious, the school’s superintendent and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:47.040
his council hold a meeting with Mrs. Wells. 
She nervously asks the board of men to wait for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:52.080
a week or two for the situation to blow over. But&nbsp;
the superintendent claims they cannot wait because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:57.280
the parents are suing the school for emotional&nbsp;
distress to a minor. Mrs. Wells exclaims that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:02.480
only said two plus two is four, which shouldn’t&nbsp;
have caused this much trouble. The board members&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:07.440
scoff at the comment and reply that she should&nbsp;
admit the possibility of multiple correct answers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:13.760
to the same question. Mrs. Wells is in absolute&nbsp;
disbelief. She knows that she is right but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:19.920
world seems to have changed to a weird place&nbsp;
where every answer must be true and every fact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:24.720
is debatable. The principal accuses her of&nbsp;
portraying everyone who disagrees with her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:30.240
as stupids. When Mrs. Wells stays put in her&nbsp;
opinion, the board members suspend her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:36.400
ask her to reconsider her extremist views if she&nbsp;
ever wants to get back to her job. The next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.640
Mrs. Wells packs up all her belongings&nbsp;
from the school and returns home. 
&nbsp;

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:45.920
At night, she watches the TV and finds out that&nbsp;
the scandal has made the national television.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:51.120
Many political leaders are debating if two&nbsp;
plus two equals twenty-two or four. The media&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:56.480
exaggerates the news and calls Mrs. Wells an&nbsp;
activist who was caught abusing a kid’s first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:02.000
amendment rights. She is being called a liberal&nbsp;
elitist for saying that four is the definite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:07.280
answer to the simple question. Some even belittle&nbsp;
Mrs. Wells for not keeping the students in her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:11.840
class for more than a year, to which Mrs.&nbsp;
Wells angrily says it’s called graduating.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:17.360
While she is watching the news, annoyed at the&nbsp;
stupidity of the reporters, she gets a call from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:23.200
the school. The principal informs her that she has&nbsp;
officially been fired. He also asks her to come by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:29.200
the school the next day and requests her to stop&nbsp;
radicalizing the students. The following day, Mrs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.440
Wells goes to the school for the last time.
As she walks through the entrance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:38.240
she is greeted by a group of reporters patiently&nbsp;
waiting for her. The school has invited them to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:43.520
prove they do not support Mrs. Wells’s extremist&nbsp;
view and to make it clear she is no longer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:48.560
their employee. Before officially signing the&nbsp;
papers and ending her contract with the school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:54.080
the principal says he will pay her the monthly&nbsp;
salary for the last two terms. The salary rounds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:59.520
up to two thousand dollars for the last month and&nbsp;
two thousand for this one. The principal says that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:05.600
is four thousand dollars in total but at last,&nbsp;
Mrs. Wells claps back and claims it is actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:11.280
twenty-two thousand dollars. The movie ends as the&nbsp;
principal awkwardly looks towards the reporters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:16.080
and back at a smiling Mrs. Wells. 
